From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Local: media: cedrus: add experimental H616/H618 H.264 encoding

Expose a stateful encoder through a separate V4L2 device.
Share hardware scheduling with decoding and guard the encoder IP.
Enable the encoder by default. Keep h264_encode=0 as an override.
Support Baseline I/P pictures, fixed QP, and NV12 up to 4096x4096.
Apply vendor SID limits. Signal negotiated timing and AVC levels.

Buffer layout algorithms follow Bootlin's Cedrus encoder.
Register conversions follow vendor binary analysis with decompr.

Link: https://github.com/bootlin/linux/tree/4e9497947c56f10351ed8c000605dbe47d4aee46/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus
Link: https://github.com/ensapra/decompr
Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
